msgstr "Conserver cet enregistrement attribué : ex:review gmeow:reviewDisposition gmeow:bankReviewRelabel ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewRestoreSnapshot|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "restore snapshot"
msgstr "restaurer un instantané"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewRestoreSnapshot|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The reviewer decided to restore a prior snapshot as a successor revision, preserving the original snapshot and intervening history."
msgstr "L’agent a décidé de restaurer un instantané antérieur comme révision suivante, en conservant l’instantané original et l’historique intermédiaire."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewRestoreSnapshot|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "Utiliser pour conserver cette partie d’un enregistrement de mémoire attribué ou ses preuves sources exactes."

