msgstr "Conserver cet enregistrement attribué : ex:review gmeow:reviewDisposition gmeow:bankReviewRestoreSnapshot ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewProposeWiderAudience|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "propose wider audience version"
msgstr "proposer une version à audience élargie"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewProposeWiderAudience|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The reviewer proposed a version for a wider audience. A proposal is not publication, permission or proof that the current revision may be released."
msgstr "L’agent a proposé une version pour une audience élargie. Une proposition n’est ni publication, ni permission, ni preuve que la révision courante peut être divulguée."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewProposeWiderAudience|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an attributed memory record or its exact source evidence."
msgstr "Utiliser pour conserver cette partie d’un enregistrement de mémoire attribué ou ses preuves sources exactes."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/bankReviewProposeWiderAudience|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
